{"4004610": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "WE’RE STILL HERE", "steam_appid": 4004610, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WE’RE STILL HERE</strong> is not just a game.<br>It’s a story about those who stayed. About those who survived. And about those who are gone. We are still here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival in a city under siege during the full-scale russian invasion of Ukraine.<br>The game is based on real eyewitness accounts and documentary facts to convey the feeling of despair, fear, and the struggle for life among the ruins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We do not glorify war.<br>There is only you — an ordinary person trying to survive in an encircled city while artillery chaotically shells residential areas, enemy troops show no mercy to civilians, and rumors and chaos drive people mad.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival in a besieged city</strong> — resources are limited, and every step outside might be your last.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Loot and craft</strong> — search for food, medicine, and tools, and create everything necessary to withstand the siege or escape the city.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Co-op mode</strong> — play online with friends or other players, share responsibilities, and join forces to increase your chances of survival.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple endings</strong> — your choices determine your fate: escape the city or remain among its ruins.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmosphere</strong> — experience what people truly had to endure in reality.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychological depth</strong> — beyond physical survival, face fear, despair, and the paranoia of spreading rumors.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an attempt to preserve the memory of war and make it felt by those who have never lived through a siege.<br>There are no superheroes here. Only people struggling to survive as the city turns into hell.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WE’RE STILL HERE</strong> is not just a game.<br>It’s a story about those who stayed. About those who survived. And about those who are gone. We are still here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival in a city under siege during the full-scale russian invasion of Ukraine.<br>The game is based on real eyewitness accounts and documentary facts to convey the feeling of despair, fear, and the struggle for life among the ruins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We do not glorify war.<br>There is only you — an ordinary person trying to survive in an encircled city while artillery chaotically shells residential areas, enemy troops show no mercy to civilians, and rumors and chaos drive people mad.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival in a besieged city</strong> — resources are limited, and every step outside might be your last.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Loot and craft</strong> — search for food, medicine, and tools, and create everything necessary to withstand the siege or escape the city.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Co-op mode</strong> — play online with friends or other players, share responsibilities, and join forces to increase your chances of survival.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple endings</strong> — your choices determine your fate: escape the city or remain among its ruins.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmosphere</strong> — experience what people truly had to endure in reality.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychological depth</strong> — beyond physical survival, face fear, despair, and the paranoia of spreading rumors.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an attempt to 